    "detailed_description": "Scrap Metal Heroes Rebuilt is a real-time strategy game where you can customize a set of 4 robots with over 300 parts and fight them against an AI opponent or other players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCustomize each robot with an array of parts, each with their own unique stats and abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse powerful items such as Hellfire Missiles, EMP Grenades, and Score Manipulators to aid your robots in battle, and provide and edge against your opponent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay through 3 different campaigns, fighting against rouge AI robots, aliens, and more<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTest your skill in 3 increasingly difficult endless modes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFight against other players in Multiplayer<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWork your way up the RoboLeague To unlock more powerful items",
